WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.810
Welcome to Organizational appraisal versus personal certification. In this lesson, we explore this purpose: Distinguish the assessment of an organizational unit from an individual knowledge examination..

2
00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:25.690
Consider this scenario. A learner scores 95% in a practice app and claims the employer has reached Maturity Level 3. First understand the problem before producing documentation.

3
00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:36.910
Start with two steps: Identify the subject being evaluated. Then Clarify the scope and prerequisites. Each step should be explained and evidenced.

4
00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:47.770
Continue with Distinguish knowledge from implementation evidence. Then Recognize who may issue a formal rating. Verify the results against the intended outcome.

5
00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:59.030
Stronger evidence looks like this: Evidence of actual implementation. Weaker evidence would be: An unverified claim. Triangulate independent sources.

6
00:00:59.030 --> 00:01:13.280
Now your turn. Review four documents and two interviews, identify inconsistencies and complete the mastery challenge. This video is an independent teaching explanation, not official CMMI model wording.
